  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer Pricing f2f training (November 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Transfer Pricing (TP) Course held in Jakarta from 11 to 14 November. This 4.5-day workshop, &#x201c;Fundamentals of Transfer Pricing &#x2013; Concepts and Practices,&#x201d; trained 50 participants from the Directorate General of Taxes (DGT) on key TP principles, methods, compliance requirements, and practical dispute-resolution approaches, combining theory with hands-on exercises to strengthen technical capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
